<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Continente boosts sales.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Continente boosts sales.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30</p>
<p>(In billions of escudos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit (after minorities)    2.5   vs   2.4</p>
<p>    Turnover				    125.8   vs  79.3</p>
<p>    Cashflow					6.2   vs   3.9</p>
<p>Note - Modelo Continente, part of the Sonae group, said it expected full-year profit after minorities to be flat at seven billion escudos compared with 1995. Sales were seen rising to 290 billion from 207 billion, while cashflow should be 14.8 billion against 11.8 billion.</p>
<p>($1=154.53 escudos) -- Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
